Iskra Delta Partner Emulator @PROJECT_VERSION@

Runtime layout:
  ./         Partner CMOS seed (partner_cmos.bin)
  bin/       Native executables
  shared/    Bundled non-system runtime libraries
  roms/      Original Partner CRT and GDP ROM images
  disks/     Writable seed floppy/hard-disk images (copied per user on first use)
  assets/    Fonts, UI assets, and icons (including partner.ico and mcp.ico)
  docs/      Command-line and hardware documentation

Windows layout:
  ./         partner.exe, idp-mcp.exe, and partner_cmos.bin (system DLLs stay in Windows)
  roms/      Original Partner CRT and GDP ROM images
  disks/     Writable seed floppy/hard-disk images (copied per user on first use)
  assets/    Fonts, UI assets, and icons (including partner.ico and mcp.ico)
  docs/      Command-line and hardware documentation

Package version: @PROJECT_VERSION@
